    planet: 'SUN',
    house: 'HOUSE9',
    title: 'Sun in 9th House',
    core: `Your Sun in the 9th house means your sense of purpose is organized around meaning-making, exploration, and expanding beyond what you currently know. Your identity is connected to learning, travel, and philosophical understanding. The 9th house is the domain of higher education, long journeys, belief systems, and the search for truth. Your Sun here makes your conscious self inseparable from your need to understand life in larger contexts. You experience yourself through what you're learning and where you're going. Your vitality comes from expanding your worldview, from traveling to unfamiliar places, from the assurance that there's always more to know. You don't settle into comfortable certainty. Your identity forms through ongoing exploration. The challenge is distinguishing between genuine learning and restless escape from commitment.`,
