    core: `When Jupiter is placed in the 3rd house, expansion and growth are expressed through learning broadly, optimistic communication, and philosophical approach to the immediate environment. Jupiter in the 3rd house experiences growth through learning and communication—they learn optimistically and broadly, communicate with enthusiasm, and mental life includes philosophical dimension. The developmental arc moves from scattered learning to focused wisdom-seeking, from talking excessively to meaningful communication. At its best, capacity for broad understanding, for inspiring communication, and for seeing larger meaning in everyday life.`,
    behavioral: `Behaviorally, manifests as enthusiasm for learning, optimistic expansive communication, and broad intellectual interests. Learns broadly and optimistically, communicates with enthusiasm and faith, sees philosophical meaning in daily life. Development task is developing depth alongside breadth, listening alongside speaking, grounding optimistic ideas in reality.`,
