    title: 'Jupiter in 4th House',
    core: `When Jupiter is placed in the 4th house, expansion and growth are expressed through creating expansive home, emotional generosity, and finding meaning through family and roots. Jupiter in the 4th house experiences growth through home and emotional life—home is often spacious or welcoming, emotional life includes optimism and faith, and family may be important to meaning. The developmental arc moves from taking emotional security for granted to conscious appreciation, from expanding home without limit to wise creation of sanctuary. At its best, capacity for creating genuinely welcoming home, for emotional generosity, and for finding faith through roots.`,
    behavioral: `Behaviorally, manifests as expansive comfortable home, emotional optimism and generosity, and family that may be important or expansive. Creates welcoming spacious home, approaches emotional life with faith and optimism. Development task is grounding emotional optimism, balancing expansion of home with other needs, appreciating emotional security without taking it for granted.`,
