    feed: `Saturn moving through 8th house. Discipline focused on transformation, intimacy, depth. Time for engaging intensity with patient discipline, for building genuine intimacy slowly, for transforming through sustained confrontation with limitation.`,
    sonic: `Saturn in 8th contributes dark, controlled quality. Music is intensely disciplined with chromatic controlled depth, rhythm is powerful but restrained, harmony is complex but structured through limitation.`,
