    core: `When Neptune is placed in the 7th house, transcendence and dissolution are focused on partnership—relationships are idealized, boundaries with partners dissolve easily, and genuine partnership requires conscious work to see partners clearly while honoring spiritual connection. The developmental arc moves from idealizing or losing self in partnership to conscious spiritual relating. At its best, capacity for profoundly spiritual partnership, relationships that serve mutual transcendence, and partnering that maintains essence while dissolving separateness.`,
